## Validate HTTP request bodies, JSON or forms, against OpenAPI 3.x specs.
##
## `OpenApi.parse` reads a spec once, and `validate_request` checks a request
## body against it and returns the JSON Schema violations it finds, each a
## `ValidationError`. The README lists the keywords that are validated, and
## the limitations.
package
	[OpenApi, ValidationError]
	{
		url: "https://github.com/niclas-ahden/roc-url/releases/download/0.7.0/DCKNTirZCLugy1ZydPLrYpefR71RYq1HFUpgQVSNvaFy.tar.zst",
	}
